bic_trace_step.reason:
The `hook_cred_transfer` function in this commit still conditionally copies the credential security blob only when `old_llcred->domain` is non-NULL (lines 25-28):

c
	if (old_llcred->domain) {
		landlock_get_ruleset(old_llcred->domain);
		*landlock_cred(new) = *old_llcred;
	}


This prevents copying other fields of `landlock_cred_security` (such as `domain_exec` or other flags) when there is no domain associated, which is the root cause of the vulnerability.
